WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:11.240
We have seen an incredible shift where Donald
Trump has signaled that if only 200000 people

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:17.500
die of Corona virus in the United States,
that would be considered a very good job.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.730
We are seeing such a goalpost move here that
it might actually trick his followers because

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:26.490
of how drastically the goalposts are being
moved.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.970
I want to remind you, we have an incompetent,
failed response to the virus.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.480
This has resulted in Trump's last tool,

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:40.180
so to speak, which is gaslighting his followers
so that they will hopefully forget that just

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.800
a few weeks ago, Trump was talking about.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:47.230
We've got 15 cases and that number will soon
be zero.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.680
Other countries were acting like adults.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.010
They were preparing for the pandemic.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:57.690
Here is Trump Sunday saying, you know, if
we end up with no more than 200000 people

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:58.690
dying.

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:00.460
Not cases, deaths.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:04.110
OK, that would be a very good job.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:08.450
And Trump sort of cleverly mentioning, you
know, one estimate said 2.2 million might

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:11.780
die if we can keep it to 200000 deaths.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.289
That would be a big.

00:01:13.289 --> 00:01:15.249
Very good job that we did not see.

00:01:15.249 --> 00:01:23.049
You're talking about 2.2 million deaths, 2.2
million people from this.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:29.689
And so if we could hold that down, as we're
saying, to 100000, it's a horrible number,

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:32.909
maybe even less, but two one hundred thousand.

00:01:32.909 --> 00:01:36.540
So we have between one hundred and two hundred
thousand.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.729
We all together have done a very good job.

00:01:38.729 --> 00:01:46.840
But so recall that Trump tweeted on March
9th that this is nothing compared to the flu

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:51.229
because the flu might kill 27000 to 70000
people.

00:01:51.229 --> 00:01:56.390
Saying, quote, So last year, 37000 Americans
died from the common flu.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:59.749
It averages 27 to 70000 per year.

00:01:59.749 --> 00:02:00.859
Nothing is shut down.

00:02:00.859 --> 00:02:03.899
Life and the economy go on at this moment.

00:02:03.899 --> 00:02:08.929
There are five hundred forty six confirmed
cases of coronavirus with 22 deaths.

00:02:08.929 --> 00:02:10.869
Think about that now.

00:02:10.869 --> 00:02:16.480
At the time, 22 deaths, now 3000 and climbing
in the United States.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.930
And the same Trump who said this isn't as
bad as the flu.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:23.900
Sometimes up to 70000 die because of the flu
each year.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:24.900
Rarely.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:32.170
But sometimes he's now saying if we stay below
200000 deaths, not cases, we will have done

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.720
a good job.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:40.129
Remember, here was Trump saying we have 15
cases and it will soon be zero.

00:02:40.129 --> 00:02:41.890
We've done really an extraordinary job.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:45.750
When you look at a country this size with
so many people pouring in with the number

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:50.440
one in the world for people coming into a
country by far.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:54.280
And we have a total of 15 cases.

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:58.470
And again, when you have 15 people and the
15 within a couple of days is going to be

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.720
down to close to zero.

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:05.909
That's a pretty good job we've done.

00:03:05.909 --> 00:03:13.319
And now, if we don't lose more than hundred
thousand people, it means Trump did a very

00:03:13.319 --> 00:03:14.530
good job.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:20.200
This is a hell of a lot of deaths for something
that five weeks ago was nothing and just the

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.230
latest Democratic hoax.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:27.120
So it's really, really important that we don't
take our eye off the ball.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.769
This is a pandemic.

00:03:28.769 --> 00:03:30.319
This is a tragedy.

00:03:30.319 --> 00:03:32.650
At some point we will get past it.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:34.420
We will have some death toll.

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:38.180
The latest estimates are about 83000 for this
wave.

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:42.829
We could then have a second wave in the fall
and another wave in 2021.

00:03:42.829 --> 00:03:45.720
We could get to 200000 by the time it's all
said and done.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.269
We don't know yet.

00:03:47.269 --> 00:03:49.739
But at some point, it's going to be done.

00:03:49.739 --> 00:03:57.760
We can't forget the incompetence and the lying
and the deception and say, hey, we made it.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:58.760
Those of us that do

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.189
make it and hopefully as many of us as possible
will be in that group.

00:04:02.189 --> 00:04:07.550
We have to remember that we've been led by
one of the worst responses in the world to

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:08.719
the virus.

00:04:08.719 --> 00:04:09.829
Maybe Iran did worse.

00:04:09.829 --> 00:04:10.950
I don't know.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.599
China lied a lot.

00:04:12.599 --> 00:04:13.599
Sure.

00:04:13.599 --> 00:04:16.840
But look at how quickly South Korea developed
and deployed a test.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.680
They had their first case on the same day
we did.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:23.060
South Korea has 150 deaths total.

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:24.680
Not in one day total.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.669
We have hundreds dying every day.

00:04:26.669 --> 00:04:29.960
It appears it will soon be thousands dying
per day.

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:35.220
We need to ensure that there is a consequence
for Trump.

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:39.880
And now this framing that he's doing of, listen,
it's a big win if we keep the death toll to

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.270
200000.

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:43.820
He previously said we have a few cases.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.330
It will soon be none.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:49.389
We now are having potentially hundreds of
thousands

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:50.389
of deaths.

00:04:50.389 --> 00:04:52.660
We can't let him get away with it.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.210
His followers are going through.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.210
We can't.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.910
Enough of us have to remember that we need
a change.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:01.340
In November of twenty twenty so that he cannot
get away with this.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.530
There are medical components here.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.340
There are social, social, cultural components
here.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.340
Economic.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.750
There are so many considerations.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:12.190
But we've been failed by the Trump administration.

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:14.020
And there has to be a consequence for that.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:14.920
I don't know if there will be, but I hope
there is

